    "detailed_description": "Venture into this platform game in the Metroidvania genre with a fantastic 2D open world with pixelated graphics in its best retro style.<br><br>Moses is on vacation in Egypt, until the terrible Ramses, prince of Egypt, kidnaps his beautiful girlfriend. The hero will have to traverse the scorching desert, descend deep underground and explore the dangerous pyramid of Ramses to find the girl, facing many challenges with enemies, traps, secret passages and bosses.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526860/extras/2771c49244797c6fefeeca28b34572b2.avif?t=1739537295\" /></span><br>To accomplish his mission, Moses will count on his weapons, power-ups and items scattered or hidden throughout the map. There will also be shops selling items, power-ups, supplies and hints, so collect as many coins as you can find along the way, including the secret treasure rooms.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526860/extras/a1382cafb9ee000347e54b6b482415f9.avif?t=1739537295\" /></span><br>Exodus has a save game system, fast travel around the map, achievements in missions, inventory to be able to carry helpful items for the journey, such as life potions, edibles, keys to open doors and much more.<br><br>Take on this adventure and test yourself in the challenges of this incredible game, until you complete 100% of the map.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526860/extras/e2d5aefed55aca5a94be9d96890ce895.avif?t=1739537295\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Venture into this platform game in the Metroidvania genre with a fantastic 2D open world with pixelated graphics in its best retro style.<br><br>Moses is on vacation in Egypt, until the terrible Ramses, prince of Egypt, kidnaps his beautiful girlfriend. The hero will have to traverse the scorching desert, descend deep underground and explore the dangerous pyramid of Ramses to find the girl, facing many challenges with enemies, traps, secret passages and bosses.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526860/extras/2771c49244797c6fefeeca28b34572b2.avif?t=1739537295\" /></span><br>To accomplish his mission, Moses will count on his weapons, power-ups and items scattered or hidden throughout the map. There will also be shops selling items, power-ups, supplies and hints, so collect as many coins as you can find along the way, including the secret treasure rooms.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526860/extras/a1382cafb9ee000347e54b6b482415f9.avif?t=1739537295\" /></span><br>Exodus has a save game system, fast travel around the map, achievements in missions, inventory to be able to carry helpful items for the journey, such as life potions, edibles, keys to open doors and much more.<br><br>Take on this adventure and test yourself in the challenges of this incredible game, until you complete 100% of the map.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526860/extras/e2d5aefed55aca5a94be9d96890ce895.avif?t=1739537295\" /></span>",
    "short_description": "Save Moses' girlfriend from the clutches of the prince of Egypt, Ramses, in this thrilling adventure across the Egyptian desert. Face enemies and bosses, find items and power-ups scattered throughout a fantastic 2D open world full of challenges, secrets and much more!",
